                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is functional but very bad.\nThe world our characters live in seems to be interesting but the actions said characters take are so completely detached from it you cannot take the story seriously.\nThe dialogue writing is also so bad it's laughable.\n\nWhen they are not tedious, the puzzles are just simplistic or nonsensical.\n\nIn the end Shardlight looks like a wannabe serious post-apocalyptic game with serious themes but everything is treated so lightly I couldn't feel anything apart from boredom.\n\nHuge pass",
